message: "If you reference this work, please cite it as below."
title: "GPS Spoofing & Aviation Security Research (SDR / HackRF One)"
abstract: >-
  A controlled, RF-isolated demonstration of GNSS (GPS) spoofing against
  aviation-grade navigation using a Software-Defined Radio (HackRF One) and
  GPS-SDR-SIM, with NASA CDDIS broadcast ephemeris, analyzing aviation security
  risks and GNSS anti-spoofing countermeasures.
type: software
